# A flag glued to a moving slime block fires an observer that is not next to the slime; the
# observer pulses once after the move out and once after the move back, and stays where it is
# (probe value 0 = an unpowered observer, "." would mean it was dragged away).
design designs/gadgets/flag-observer.txt
probe obs 3 3 0
probe old 2 2 0
probe new 3 2 0
use 0 1 0
expect_trace obs 00110000
expect new #
expect old .
expect obs 0
use 0 1 0
expect_trace obs 00110000
expect old #
expect new .
expect obs 0
